  npcName: Old Man
  npcPotrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b88e00c39c72f6f4c8e2d6df3b640cb9, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - "Ah\u2026 so you are the one Master Hiroshi spoke of."
  - "He sent you here to face the final trial\u2026 the one that decides whether
    you are worthy to be called a true ninja."
  - "These lands were once peaceful. But now\u2026 four islands are cursed."
  - "To complete your training, you must cleanse these islands\u2026 and destroy
    the demons that dwell within."
  - You will recognize a cursed place by the eye symbol carved outside its walls.
  - "That mark watches\u2026 and waits."
  - Enter only when you are prepared.
  - "Return alive\u2026 and your training will be complete."
  typingSpeed: 0.05
